<LanguageData>
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle][asker_nameFull]向我们透露了一条消息。看起来，旅途中的[siteFaction_pawnsPlural]与他们的驮运动物正在我们附近的某处停歇。\n[asker_nameDef]告诉了我们这支商队的落脚处，或许可以打他们一个措手不及。<!--EN: questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has informed us about a siege camp belonging to [siteFaction_name], set up near your location. They seem to be gathering numbers and will imminently attack your colony at [map_definite].\nIf you choose to attack preemptively, you will only need to face:\n[ListOfEnemies]\n\nIf you wait, they are bound to increase their numbers and will eventually attack you with a much larger force:\n[ListOfPotentialEnemies]--><li>[asker_faction_name] 的 questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;[asker_nameFull]、[asker_faction_leaderTitle] 已通知我们，在您所在位置附近设立了一个属于 [siteFaction_name] 的攻城营。它们似乎正在聚集人数，即将攻击您位于 [map_definite] 的殖民地。
如果您选择先发制人，您只需要面对：
[ListOfEnemies]

如果您等待，它们会 绑住的 增加数量，最终会以更大的数量攻击您力：
[ListOfPotentialEnemies]</li><!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==true)->You have found out that there is a siege camp belonging to [siteFaction_name], set up near your location. They seem to be gathering numbers and will imminently attack your colony at [map_definite].\nIf you choose to attack preemptively, you will only need to face:\n[ListOfEnemies]\n\nIf you wait, they are bound to increase their numbers and will eventually attack you with a much larger force:\n[ListOfPotentialEnemies]--><li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true)-&gt;你发现有一个属于[siteFaction_name]的攻城营，设立在你的位置附近。它们似乎正在聚集人数，即将攻击您位于 [map_definite] 的殖民地。
如果您选择先发制人，您只需要面对：
[ListOfEnemies]

如果您等待，它们会 绑住的 增加数量，最终会以更大的数量攻击您力：
[ListOfPotentialEnemies]</li></VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->[siteFaction_name]'s siege camp-->
    <li>questName-&gt;[siteFaction_name]的围攻营地</li>
  </VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: Camp defeated-->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.root.nodes.14.node.nodes.0.label>营地被击败</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.root.nodes.14.node.nodes.0.label>
  <!--EN: You have successfully defeated the siege camp and the enemy forces!-->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.root.nodes.14.node.nodes.0.text>你已经成功击败了攻城营和敌军！</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.root.nodes.14.node.nodes.0.text>
  <!--EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName]-->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.root.nodes.9.node.nodes.1.label>任务已过期：[resolvedQuestName]</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.root.nodes.9.node.nodes.1.label>
  <!--EN: The siege camp was not defeated in time. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired, and the enemy forces are now raiding your colony.-->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.root.nodes.9.node.nodes.1.text>攻城营未能及时溃败。任务 [resolvedQuestName] 已过期，敌军正在袭击您的殖民地。</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_SiegeCamp.root.nodes.9.node.nodes.1.text>
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle][asker_nameFull]向我们透露了一条消息。看起来，旅途中的[siteFaction_pawnsPlural]与他们的驮运动物正在我们附近的某处停歇。\n[asker_nameDef]告诉了我们这支商队的落脚处，或许可以打他们一个措手不及。<!--EN: questDescription->[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has requested our help in a skirmish against [siteFaction_name].
\nA small force from [askerFaction_name] is engaging a larger group of [siteFaction_pawnsPlural]. The friendlies will attack immediately upon arrival, but their chances of victory without our help are slim.
\nThis is an opportunity to strengthen our bond with [askerFaction_name]. However, the enemy force is significant, and this battle will not be without risk.
\n\nAllied forces include:\n[FriendlyUnitList]
\n\nEnemies from [siteFaction_name]:\n[EnemyUnitList]--><li>questDescription-&gt;[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name] 的 [asker_faction_leaderTitle] 请求我们帮助，以对抗 [siteFaction_name]。

来自 [askerFaction_name] 的一小股部队正在与更大的 [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] 群体交战。友军抵达后会立即进攻，但如果没有我们的帮助，他们获胜的机会很小。

这是加强我们与[askerFaction_name]联系的机会。然而，敌军力量庞大，这场战斗并非没有风险。


盟军包括：
[FriendlyUnitList]


敌人来自[siteFaction_name]:
[EnemyUnitList]</li></VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
